VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'projects. [music] First off, what is a project? A project is where the fun really begins. It\'s a hub where you can invite other team members, import your 3D assets, and of course, create scenes where you can perform and bring all your'

[01:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'ideas to life. Let\'s create a new project, and we\'ll run through all you need to know to get started. In the projects tab, click create a new [music] project. The first thing to do is to give your project a name. Next, you can choose a template.'

[01:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Animotive comes with five fully loaded templates to get you started. Light world, dark world, fantasy adventures, festive, and workshop world. Our light world is a colorful, bright, optimistic'

