AUDIO: 'unique characters, three sets, and plenty of cool props [music] to inspire you. Fantasy Adventures takes you to a mythical world by Kkit with four characters, three sets, and props to play with. Festive is our lightworld'

[02:22] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'asset pack redressed for the festive period with new character outfits and props. Workshop World is the perfect set for previsualizing scenes. Equipped with a blank set, five mannequin characters, and loads of props to use. If you choose'

[02:35] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'a blank template, this gives you the opportunity to start from scratch. For each template, you can import your own assets, meaning you can add to what\'s already there. Clicking on create will initiate your project and it will appear'

